    "avalanche": "Reports are minimal, but human-triggered avalanches are possible where you see a smooth snow surface instead of obvious rough ground under a bit of snow. In neighboring Glacier National Park, small avalanches were reported on steep, smooth, alpine slopes during stormy periods in mid-November."
